  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-166681519b0bd66e0bea52d8",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "系统极点在 s 平面上的位置反映了其相应的瞬态响应。s 平面左半部分的极点使系统对扰动输入产生衰减响应。位于 jω 轴和右半平面上的极点则分别导致等幅响应和发散响应。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The location in the s-plane of the poles of a system indicates the resulting transient response. Poles in the left-hand portion of the s-plane result in a decreasing response for disturbance inputs. Poles on the jω-axis and in the right-hand plane result in a neutral and an increasing response, respectively.",
